=PRODUCT XMMS AXPVMS XMMS V1.2-11R1 Full
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt XMMS 1.2.11 desktop music player for OpenVMS Alpha
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt XMMS contributors and OpenVMS port contributors
1 'NOTICE
=prompt Copyright XMMS, GTK, GLib and OpenVMS Porting Library contributors
1 'LICENSE
=prompt GNU GPL / GNU Library GPL and component licenses; no XMMS PAK required
1 RUN_XMMS
=prompt Start XMMS from an existing DECwindows DECterm.
    @SYS$COMMON:[XMMS]XMMS.COM
    @SYS$COMMON:[XMMS]XMMS.COM "SYS$LOGIN:SONG.WAV"

The kit includes its GTK, GDK, GLib, GModule and Porting Library runtimes.
MMOV must be configured and running. On the ES1371 emulator, use the working
MMOV compatibility kit supplied separately with this release.

The verification procedure loads the program and displays its version.
It does not open a display or test audio playback. Installation requires
no compiler, development headers, GNV, desktop changes or XMMS startup job.

If /DESTINATION selected a different root, use that root's [XMMS] directory.
Keep XMMS-SOURCE-V1_2_11R1.ZIP with the binary kit when redistributing it.
